.TH CHTTP_STATUS_* 3 "2026-07-14" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
CHTTP_STATUS_* \- HTTP status code constants
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttp.h>

CHTTP_STATUS_CONTINUE               100
CHTTP_STATUS_SWITCHING_PROTOCOLS    101
CHTTP_STATUS_OK                     200
CHTTP_STATUS_CREATED                201
CHTTP_STATUS_ACCEPTED               202
CHTTP_STATUS_NO_CONTENT             204
CHTTP_STATUS_PARTIAL_CONTENT        206
CHTTP_STATUS_MOVED_PERMANENTLY      301
CHTTP_STATUS_FOUND                  302
CHTTP_STATUS_NOT_MODIFIED           304
CHTTP_STATUS_TEMPORARY_REDIRECT     307
CHTTP_STATUS_PERMANENT_REDIRECT     308
CHTTP_STATUS_BAD_REQUEST            400
CHTTP_STATUS_UNAUTHORIZED           401
CHTTP_STATUS_FORBIDDEN              403
CHTTP_STATUS_NOT_FOUND              404
CHTTP_STATUS_METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED     405
CHTTP_STATUS_NOT_ACCEPTABLE         406
CHTTP_STATUS_REQUEST_TIMEOUT        408
CHTTP_STATUS_CONFLICT               409
CHTTP_STATUS_GONE                   410
CHTTP_STATUS_PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE      413
CHTTP_STATUS_UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA      415
CHTTP_STATUS_UNPROCESSABLE          422
CHTTP_STATUS_TOO_MANY_REQUESTS      429
CHTTP_STATUS_INTERNAL_ERROR         500
CHTTP_STATUS_NOT_IMPLEMENTED        501
CHTTP_STATUS_BAD_GATEWAY            502
CHTTP_STATUS_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE    503
CHTTP_STATUS_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT        504
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Integer constants for common HTTP status codes.  Prefer these names
over bare integer literals to improve readability.

This is not an exhaustive list of every status code defined by the
HTTP specifications, only the ones this library's own code and test
suites reference by name; any other status code can still be used as
a plain integer literal with chttpsvr_resp_set_status() or compared
directly against chttpcli_response.status_code.
.fi
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
if (resp->status_code == CHTTP_STATUS_NOT_FOUND) { ... }

chttpsvr_resp_set_status(resp, CHTTP_STATUS_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE);
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpclient_do (3),
.BR chttpsvr_resp_set_status (3)
